# Checkpoint definition (specs/tools/checkpoints.md); tools/checkpoints/make.py
# builds the save with d2s-tool. Ids are rows of the 1.14d tables
# (levels, monstats, objects), as the traces/playthrough/act*.play
# comments name them. Gear and stats are our choice for the point.
# Catacombs 4 is level 37, Andariel monstats 156. Den of Evil +1 skill point (bonus).
# Quests done: Den of Evil 1.0, Burial Grounds 2.0, Cain 4.0 (quests.md §1.9).
